        target: {fileID: 0}
      statConsequences: []
      displayTexts:
      - 'You walk to the door ahead, passing the man to your right. He slumps to
        the ground, his back against the wall. Drool dribbles down his white, wispy
        beard. As you put your hand on the doorknob, a primordial yell stops you
        in your tracks. Confidence drained, you dare not turn to see this source,
        but your instincts kick in to protect yourself. Too late. Bloodshot eyes.
        Rancid breath. Violent guttural sounds. These fill your senses. You try to
        push him away, but for a wasted man, he has a lot of strength. His head jerks
        back, and forward it goes, headbutting you in the face. Dazed, you try to
        escape his grasp, but you cannot. He jerks back again. Then his head crashes
        down to your neck, teeth clamped down on your skin and meat. You feel a tearing
        pain, and when he pulls away, you see a chunk of meat in his mouth. Red,
        warm trickles down your chest. Pain seizes your body. The old man grinds
        the meat in his mouth as he glares at you as he return to his wall. '
